<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Nov unemployment steady at 4.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria Nov unemployment steady at 4.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Social Affairs Ministry</p>
<p>reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	November   October	Nov 1995</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce	4.1	  4.1	    4.7</p>
<p> Total			    234,505    214,293	231,809</p>
<p>NOTE - The November and October 1996 figures were calculated by the European Statistics Office and are based on a 1995 census. The November 1995 figure was calculated by the Austrian Social Affairs Ministry based on a 1994 census and is not directly comparable.</p>
<p>Since December 1995, Austria has calculated percentage of workforce according to EU standards, and all previous figures were calculated according to OECD standards.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
